#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1436
msgid ""
"Banking-aware filter. CPU view = whatever PC sees now. Specific zone = only "
"when the bank is paged in."
msgstr ""
"Filtro consapevole del banking. Vista CPU = ciò che il PC vede ora. Zona "
"specifica = solo quando il bank è mappato attivamente."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1442
msgid "Bank ID (hex):"
msgstr "ID bank (hex):"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1453
msgid "Bank Match Mode:"
msgstr "Modalità corrispondenza banco:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1455
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact bank ID (default).\n"
"Range  = trigger when active bank within [Bank ID..End Bank].\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (bank & Mask) == (Bank ID & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching multiple overlay banks at once.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = attiva su ID bank esatto (predefinito).\n"
"Range  = attiva quando il bank attivo è in [Bank ID..End Bank].\n"
"Mask   = attiva quando (bank & Mask) == (Bank ID & Mask).\n"
"         Utile per confrontare più bank overlay contemporaneamente.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1465
msgid "End Bank:"
msgstr "Bank finale:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1474
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1578
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1661
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when Match Mode = Range."
msgstr ""
"Limite superiore per il confronto RANGE (inclusivo). Attivo solo quando "
"Match Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1480
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1585
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1667
msgid "Mask:"
msgstr "Maschera:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1489
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Example: Bank=0x08, Mask=0x18 triggers on banks 8, "
"9, 10, 11 (= 0x08..0x0B with high bits cleared).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Maschera AND per il confronto MASK. Esempio: Bank=0x08, Mask=0x18 attiva sui "
"bank 8, 9, 10, 11 (= 0x08..0x0B con i bit alti azzerati).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1497
msgid "Address as:"
msgstr "Indirizzo come:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1503
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1513
